},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"34a62fa2-1b55-4610-937a-f5ab739f8710","tool_call_id":"call_de4c1de1503d4107b70cf520","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。","normalized_query":"把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将把上传的视频登记入库，并建立支持语义搜索的向量索引","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"上传的视频"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_bd704d","text":"把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_b6425e","text":"读取上传的视频文件并进行格式校验与基础信息解析，依据安防视频通用编码规范提取时长、分辨率、帧率等字段，输出结构化视频元数据清单及原始文件安全存储路径。"},{"task_span_id":"span_b6dda5","text":"针对视频监控场景特性对视频流进行分段采样与多模态特征抽取，采用基于镜头切换点的帧采样策略与语音转写技术，生成包含画面内容摘要、目标行为描述及环境要素的语义特征描述集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_443c75","text":"调用多模态向量嵌入模型对步骤二产出的语义描述集进行高维特征转换，依据统一向量维度标准计算Embedding值，配置HNSW或IVF-PQ索引算法参数，完成向量库写入与检索路由初始化。"},{"task_span_id":"span_65abfc","text":"在资产登记系统中创建视频入库记录并绑定唯一资源标识符与向量文档ID，执行跨库关联校验与预置语义检索用例测试，确认索引可用性与状态同步后输出系统接入凭证与检索API接口说明。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c8795b","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将把上传的视频登记入库，并建立支持语义搜索的向量索引。","params":{"视频对象":"上传的视频"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c8795b","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将把上传的视频登记入库，并建立支持语义搜索的向量索引。","params":{"视频对象":"上传的视频"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:1396420a-5663-4505-ade7-16eeae4dda21"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:1396420a-5663-4505-ade7-16eeae4dda21"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","